# Adventure Game
A simple 2D text-based adventure game where the player can navigate a character through a dungeon, interact with enemies, and collect treasure.

## Game Mechanics

- The game will have a simple text-based user interface.
- The player will be able to move the character up, down, left, or right through the dungeon.
- The player will encounter enemies and treasure.
- The player will need to make decisions that will affect the outcome of the game.

## Classes

- `Character`: Represents the player's character.
- `Enemy`: Represents an enemy in the dungeon.
- `Treasure`: Represents treasure in the dungeon.
- `Dungeon`: Represents the game world.

## Classes Design

