## Game Title
"Echoes of Eternity"

## Game Overview
"Echoes of Eternity" is a simple, text-based adventure game where the player navigates through a mystical realm, solving puzzles and collecting items to unlock the secrets of the ancient world.

## Game Mechanics

* The game is divided into rooms, each with its unique description and challenges.
* The player can move between rooms using basic commands (e.g., north, south, east, west).
* The player can collect and use items to solve puzzles and unlock new rooms.
* The game has a day/night cycle, affecting the behavior of certain NPCs and the availability of items.
* The player has a health system, which decreases when encountering hostile creatures or making incorrect choices.

