## Game Overview

The game is a text-based adventure game where the player has to navigate through a maze and collect treasures. The game will have a simple text-based UI, a maze navigation system, a health system, and a treasure collection system.

## Game Mechanics

### Player Movement

*   The player can move up, down, left, and right using the corresponding keyboard keys.
*   The player can only move one space at a time.
*   The game will display the current position of the player in the maze.

### Collision Detection

*   The player will collide with the maze walls, which will result in a loss of health.
*   The player will collide with the treasure, which will result in winning the game.
*   The player will not collide with themselves.

### Health System

*   The player starts with a maximum health of 5.
*   Each collision with the maze wall will reduce the player's health by 1.
*   If the player's health reaches 0, the game will end.

