# The Lost Temple of Eldarath

## Game Overview

"The Lost Temple of Eldarath" is a text-based adventure game where players take on the role of an adventurer seeking to uncover the secrets of the ancient Lost Temple of Eldarath. Explore a vast temple, interact with non-player characters, and make choices that determine the outcome of the game.

### Genre

Fantasy Adventure

### Gameplay

*   Explore a vast temple filled with puzzles and hidden treasures
*   Interact with various non-player characters, including friendly locals and treacherous guardians
*   Make choices that determine the outcome of the game
*   Engage in turn-based combat with enemies
*   Level up and unlock new skills and abilities

### Features

*   Text-based interface
*   Choose-your-own-adventure style gameplay
*   Turn-based combat system
*   Character leveling and skill progression

### Requirements

*   Python 3.x
*   Pygame
*   PyYAML

### Running the Game

To run the game, navigate to the game directory and execute the following command:

```bash
python game.py
```

### Contributing

Contributions are welcome! If you
